# Charlotte Wealth Monorepo Rules

- **Structure**: Monorepo using npm workspaces (`apps/web`, `apps/mobile`, `apps/api`, `apps/e2e`).
- **All code changes** must be made within the appropriate `apps/<workspace>` directory.
- **Development commands**:
  - `npm start`: Runs API (3000), Web (4200), and Mobile (8100) concurrently.
  - `npm run build:all`: Builds all applications.
  - `npm test`: Runs all centralized E2E Cucumber tests.
- **Testing policy**: All end-to-end, API, and mobile tests belong in `apps/e2e`.
- **Agent skills**: Modular domain skills live in `.agents/skills/` (`monorepo-workflow`, `e2e-testing`, `mobile-appium`, `angular-development`, `nestjs-api`). Cursor must utilize these skills when executing tasks.

